{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"上半屏左上方的大号白字首先进入视线，其中红色强调的“不再藏着喜欢”“我不再为它道歉”最醒目；随后容易注意到下方黄色大字块。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他意识到自己在乎对方，决定不再隐藏自己的喜欢，也不再为这份感情道歉。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"高兴、释然、不再羞愧。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他对未来关系仍然没有把握，对方以后是否愿意让他陪伴并非他能决定；两人可能不再亲近的担忧让欢喜中带着心痛。具体的回忆背景也不容易第一眼获取。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上方红色强调段落、黄色大字块和下方灰白大字块都比较显眼，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里：不再隐藏喜欢、为在乎对方感到高兴、担心未来失去亲近，需要拼接才能理解完整的处境和情绪关系。\",\n    \"单块文字包含多层意思，尤其上方段落需要读完整句才能理解前后关系。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "75bcbdec-7800-4897-b7fb-50aa091e24e2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T012203126371Z", "elapsed_seconds": 21.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:22:24.542780+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "21ff58ab76c5c04aa15dddca3115af156f77961c3d9f4d6562091607848cceb6", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f6